  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Blood can provide you with additional ki in an emergency, but at a price. You can expand your ki point total at the expense of your health.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13, Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Recover 2 ki points by taking 1 point of temporary ability burn damage to each of your three physical ability scores: Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution. You can recover additional ki points for the same cost to Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution. These recovered points add to your ki point reserve as balanced ki points as if you had gained them by resting overnight and meditating.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of ki.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Only living creatures can use this feat. You can take advantage of this feat only while in your own corporeal body.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc93\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
